WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.748
Anastasia led Mandy to another room in the palace.

2
00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:17.849
Suddenly, Mandy noticed a familiar figure holding some flowers.

3
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.583
"Vinnie!" she shouted.

4
00:00:21.584 --> 00:00:24.599
He turned around and smiled.

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.599
"Mandy!" called Vinnie.

6
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.669
He ran over to his sister.

7
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:34.722
Mandy introduced Vinnie to her new friend.

8
00:00:34.723 --> 00:00:39.128
"You're Princess Anastasia?" asked Vinnie.

9
00:00:39.129 --> 00:00:43.565
"Yes, but just call me Anya," she said.

10
00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:45.841
Vinnie turned white.

11
00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:51.538
But before Mandy could say anything, a voice interrupted.

12
00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:55.948
"Your highness, the Fabergé egg is here.

13
00:00:55.949 --> 00:00:59.687
We will begin the celebration soon."

14
00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:03.179
"Rasputin!" thought Vinnie.

15
00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.329
"Go about your duties,"

16
00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.574
ordered Rasputin, pointing to Vinnie and Mandy.

17
00:01:09.575 --> 00:01:13.836
Then in a kinder voice, to Anastasia he said,

18
00:01:13.837 --> 00:01:16.906
"Go to your parents, Princess."

19
00:01:16.907 --> 00:01:22.452
"Rasputin, you can't tell me what to do!" cried Anastasia.

20
00:01:22.453 --> 00:01:26.259
"You will listen, little one," he said.

21
00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:30.567
"I am your mother's closest advisor. Obey me!"

22
00:01:30.568 --> 00:01:35.825
Anastasia stamped her feet and walked off with Rasputin.

23
00:01:35.826 --> 00:01:41.736
"Something bad is going to happen," Vinnie whispered to Mandy.

24
00:01:41.737 --> 00:01:45.353
"How do you know?" asked Mandy.

25
00:01:45.354 --> 00:01:48.293
"What are you talking about?"

26
00:01:48.294 --> 00:01:53.604
"I can't believe you don't get it!" Vinnie nearly shouted.

27
00:01:53.605 --> 00:01:56.537
"She's Princess Anastasia!

28
00:01:56.538 --> 00:02:00.133
Don't you remember the movie we saw?"

29
00:02:00.134 --> 00:02:02.999
Mandy grabbed Vinnie's arm.

30
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.363
"The Romanovs!" she said.

31
00:02:06.364 --> 00:02:08.582
"Now I remember.

32
00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:11.868
The whole family gets murdered.

33
00:02:11.869 --> 00:02:15.591
We have to do something!"

34
00:02:15.592 --> 00:02:20.109
The horror of it made Mandy cry.

35
00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:23.245
Vinnie held his sister's hands.

36
00:02:23.246 --> 00:02:28.642
"Mandy, we can't change history," he said sadly.

37
00:02:28.643 --> 00:02:34.092
At that moment, two men in military uniforms walked by.

38
00:02:34.093 --> 00:02:38.541
They were carrying a gold box on a red cushion.

39
00:02:38.542 --> 00:02:43.154
Nearby, some servants whispered in excitement.

40
00:02:43.155 --> 00:02:47.158
"That must be the new egg," said Vinnie.

41
00:02:47.159 --> 00:02:52.107
The men carried the box into the palace reception room.

42
00:02:52.108 --> 00:02:55.405
They left the door slightly open.

43
00:02:55.406 --> 00:02:58.599
Vinnie and Mandy peered through.

44
00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:03.987
In the reception room, the royal family stood near a small table.

45
00:03:03.988 --> 00:03:06.997
Anna Pavlova was there too.

46
00:03:06.998 --> 00:03:10.675
Rasputin stood next to the czarina.

47
00:03:10.676 --> 00:03:15.759
The czar took the box and pulled out a green colored egg.

48
00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:20.071
"It looks like a tree!" cried Anastasia.

49
00:03:20.072 --> 00:03:26.087
The egg was supported by a short stick and covered in leaves made of jade.

50
00:03:26.088 --> 00:03:29.726
The tree's fruit were colorful jewels.

51
00:03:29.727 --> 00:03:31.872
Vinnie took out the photo:

52
00:03:31.873 --> 00:03:34.358
it was glowing blue.

53
00:03:34.359 --> 00:03:40.531
"What's this?" said the czarina, touching a lever on the side of the egg.

54
00:03:40.532 --> 00:03:44.363
Suddenly, the top of the tree opened.

55
00:03:44.364 --> 00:03:49.196
A little bird popped out as a melody filled the room.

56
00:03:49.197 --> 00:03:52.597
Everyone clapped.

57
00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:56.728
"The photo!" Mandy whispered.

58
00:03:56.729 --> 00:03:59.966
The object in the photo was the bird.

59
00:03:59.967 --> 00:04:03.730
It was glowing red.

60
00:04:03.731 --> 00:04:09.594
Just as Mandy closed her eyes, she saw Anastasia wink at her.

61
00:04:09.595 --> 00:04:16.227
The children fell down the dark tunnel.

62
00:04:16.228 --> 00:04:20.995
The next thing they knew, they were home in the attic again.

63
00:04:20.996 --> 00:04:23.833
Mom stood in the doorway.

64
00:04:23.834 --> 00:04:28.484
"My eyes! What was that light?" she shouted.

65
00:04:28.485 --> 00:04:32.081
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

66
00:04:32.082 --> 00:04:39.040
They were in trouble.
